UPDATE companies SET description='Colite Technologies is based in Columbia, South Carolina, and was founded in 2018.

The firm designs and delivers customized solar, battery, and hybrid energy systems for commercial and industrial clients. Its service portfolio spans commercial solar installation, energy storage solutions, solar system design, energy resilience and microgrid integration, maintenance and monitoring, project financing and ownership structures, and off-grid renewable lighting. Colite manages the full project lifecycle from engineering and permitting through construction, commissioning, and ongoing operations.

Colite serves manufacturing facilities, distribution centers, agricultural operations, and corporate campuses across the United States. Representative projects include a 661-kW rooftop solar and 60-kWh battery system for Sportsman Boats in Summerville, SC; a 121-kW system for Coca-Cola Bottling United; a 197-kW installation for Extra Space Storage in Woodbridge; a 203-kW system for CubeSmart Self Storage; and a 287-kW array for Peach State Trucking. Additional clients include Clemson University, Sandia National Laboratories, Bon Secours St. Francis Health System, and the Pro Football Hall of Fame.

The company states its mission is to deliver cutting-edge solar solutions that enhance performance, cut costs, and promote environmental responsibility. Its guiding principles emphasize integrity, innovation, and customer success. Colite differentiates itself by helping clients navigate federal and state incentives, optimize how power is used, stored, and sold back to the grid, and by offering non-penetrative roof installations, comprehensive roof inspections, and full permitting management.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Commercial solar installation", "Energy storage solutions", "Solar system design", "Energy resilience & microgrids", "Maintenance & monitoring", "Project financing & ownership", "Off-grid renewable lighting", "EV charging equipment installation"], "industries": ["Manufacturing", "Distribution/Logistics", "Agriculture", "Commercial Real Estate"], "materials": ["Commercial solar PV systems", "Off-grid renewable lighting systems", "EV charging equipment", "Battery storage systems"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Full-service distributed energy solutions provider covering design, installation, financing, and operations", "Expertise in navigating federal and state incentives to maximize project value", "Non-penetrative solar installations for flat and low-slope roofs with pre- and post-installation roof inspections", "Real-time monitoring and proactive maintenance, including repair of third-party systems", "Flexible project financing options including direct ownership, PPAs, and leases"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2018 -> db", "Headquarters in Columbia, South Carolina -> db", "Full-service Distributed Energy Solutions Provider -> page /", "Services: Commercial Solar Installation, Energy Storage Solutions, Solar System Design, Energy Resilience & Microgrids, Maintenance & Monitoring, Project Financing & Ownership, Off-grid Renewable Lighting -> page /", "Industries served: 