UPDATE companies SET description='Commercial Plastics Corp. operates from Arlington, Washington, where it has served the plastic fabrication market for over three decades. The company''s history emphasizes deep industry experience rather than a specific founding date or ownership structure, and no individual founders are named in public materials.

