UPDATE companies SET description='Component Dynamics operates from Portsmouth, New Hampshire, as an independent supplier of electronic components. The company specializes in sourcing obsolete, last-time-buy, and hard-to-find parts through a global network of qualified sources.

The firm provides component sourcing, excess inventory management, obsolescence mitigation, cost-savings programs, and warehousing and fulfillment services. Its inventory is held across three accredited hubs in North America, Europe, and Asia, each certified to ISO 9001, ISO 14001, and ANSI/ESD S2020 standards. A multi-stage inspection process and an in-house vendor rating program support its quality system.

The company''s AS9120B and AS6081 certifications reflect its focus on the aviation and defense supply chains, while its participation in the Government Industry Data Exchange Program (GIDEP) further aligns it with public-sector procurement.

