UPDATE companies SET description='Constant Technologies is headquartered in North Kingstown, Rhode Island, and has spent more than 40 years focusing exclusively on mission-critical command and control centers. President Brad Righi leads a team that includes AIA-certified architects and CTS-D-accredited audiovisual engineers.

