UPDATE companies SET description='Control Components, Inc. operates from Pelham, Alabama, where it has served the factory automation and machine safety market for 35 years. The Alabama corporation is independent of the California-based IMI Critical Engineering entity that shares a similar name.

Its product range spans sensors (inductive, photoelectric, ultrasonic, limit switches), machine safety devices (light curtains, safety relays, safety switches, safety mats, scanners), control panel components (timers, relays, contactors, circuit breakers, terminal blocks, power supplies), industrial communication (Ethernet switches), and process measurement and control instruments. The Pelham facility maintains supporting inventory and a factory-trained sales staff to assist with product selection.

