UPDATE companies SET description='Corteco USA operates from Milan, Ohio, as the North American arm of the global Freudenberg Group. The company serves the independent automotive aftermarket with a portfolio that carries the Freudenberg engineering heritage, though a founding year for the U.S. entity is not publicly disclosed.

