UPDATE companies SET description='Cox Brothers Food Equipment Repair was established in 2002 in Rolla, Missouri, and is owned by Nick Cox. The company began serving restaurants, grocery stores, and convenience stores across Mid-Missouri with a focus on commercial refrigeration and food equipment repair.

