UPDATE companies SET description='Today the company provides full-service manufacturing under one roof: welding and fabrication (including heavy plate forming, waterjet cutting, and certified structural welding), precision CNC machining (turning and milling up to 22-inch diameter), materials processing (raw stock management, precision sawing), coating and assembly (multi-layer protective coatings, sub-assembly, turnkey builds), and engineering and design (DFM analysis). The facility houses equipment such as a Marvel computerized band saw, a Flow water jet, a Mazak 7K laser cutter, and a Diamond BH 8525 press brake.

